{"availability":"available","full":"muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot","name":"ai-support-chatbot","description":"Embeddable AI customer support chat widget that answers from a business's own knowledge base — built on a demo plumbing site (Next.js + Groq/Llama)","category":"Business","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":2,"created":"2026-08-16T08:08:06Z","updated":"2026-08-16T16:40:14Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ai-support-chatbot-plum.vercel.app","topics":["ai-chatbot","ai-chatbot-development-companies","ai-chatbot-saas","chat-widget","customer-support","customer-support-ai","customer-support-assistant","customer-support-automation","customer-support-chatbot","groq-ai","groq-api","groq-integration","javascript","llama","nextjs","rag","rag-chatbot","rag-pipeline","react","reactjs"],"demo":"https://ai-support-chatbot-plum.vercel.app/embed-demo.html","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.214Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.214Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.214Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","stars":0,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-15T23:46:11.214Z","stars":0,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Most small businesses don't need a full AI product — they need one thing: a chatbot on their website that actually knows their prices, hours, and policies instead of giving generic, made-up answers. This project is a portfolio build showing exactly that service end-to-end.","It's a complete, working example: a small business website (\"AquaFix Plumbing,\" a fictional plumbing company) with a floating AI chat widget in the bottom-right corner. Ask it about pricing, hours, service area, or emergency callouts, and it answers from that business's real data — not a generic ChatGPT wrapper. Ask it something outside that scope (like car repair), and it correctly says so and hands off to a human instead of making something up.","The point of building it this way — a real site plus a portable widget plus a documented backend — is to demonstrate the actual deliverable a client buys: \"add AI chat to my existing site,\" not a AI chatbot in isolation."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0bdb38539d58e8a9ab29013f636cf63a0891ffa8822a1b6a967c2a8f01cf310d","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:13.000Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:13.000Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Most small businesses don't need a full AI product — they need one thing: a chatbot on their website that actually knows their prices, hours, and policies instead of giving generic, made-up answers. This project is a portfolio build showing exactly that service end-to-end.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"0bdb38539d58e8a9ab29013f636cf63a0891ffa8822a1b6a967c2a8f01cf310d","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:13.000Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-08-16T16:40:14Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/muhammadhassan-web/ai-support-chatbot/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:13.000Z","hash":"0bdb38539d58e8a9ab29013f636cf63a0891ffa8822a1b6a967c2a8f01cf310d","originalBytes":5099,"storedBytes":5099,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:02:12.920Z","subjects":["Automation & workflows","Chatbots & assistants","Writing & documents"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Business","subjects":["Automation & workflows","Chatbots & assistants","Writing & documents"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Automation & workflows","source":"metadata","match":"automation"},{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chatbot"},{"subject":"Writing & docu